# Read by supercronic in the archivist container. Times are in the
# container's TZ, which compose.yaml sets to America/Los_Angeles.
#
# 00:10 Pacific, as on epyc. Each night's topic is named for its UTC date,
# and at 00:10 Pacific the UTC date is already that of the night in progress.
# The run lasts 7 hours, to just past dawn at Palomar.
10 0 * * * /usr/local/bin/nightly.sh
